# A rule, not a list: where neither the fixing commit's parent nor an older commit with the same
# buggy file compiles, the warning was reproduced on the fixing commit with only the target file
# put back. That is not a state the project was ever in; such tasks are left out (2026-10-02).
DISCARDED.update({t: 'buggy_never_compiles' for t, row in embedded_warnings().items()
                  if row['environment'] == 'fix-commit' and t not in DISCARDED})


